    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington is delighted to present this bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment ideally located on Cork Street in the heart of Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a generous open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, a spacious double bedroom and a main bathroom. The living area is well proportioned and benefits from excellent natural light, timber flooring and direct access to a private balcony.\r\n\r\nThe fitted kitchen includes a range of wall and floor-level storage units, tiled flooring and integrated appliances. The double bedroom is particularly spacious and also provides access to the balcony, while the bathroom is fitted with a bath and overhead shower, wash-hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from a designated car-parking space, a particularly valuable feature in this central Dublin location.\r\n\r\nSouth Gate is a well-established development positioned within walking distance of Dublin city centre, St Patrick’s Cathedral, Christchurch, The Liberties, Griffith College and the Coombe Hospital. The area is well served by shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport, with convenient access to the LUAS and numerous Dublin Bus routes.\r\n\r\nNo. 71 is likely to appeal to first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors seeking a spacious apartment with parking in one of Dublin’s most convenient and increasingly popular neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nA welcoming entrance hallway with timber flooring, an intercom system and access to the principal rooms.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room\r\nA bright and generously proportioned open-plan living and dining area with timber flooring and ample space for both seating and dining furniture. Glazed doors provide direct access to the private balcony.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nAn open-plan fitted kitchen with a selection of wall and floor-level storage units, tiled splashback, tiled flooring and integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\nA spacious double bedroom with timber flooring and excellent natural light. A glazed door provides direct access to the balcony.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nFitted with a bath and overhead shower, wash-hand basin and WC, with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.\r\n\r\nBalcony\r\nA private balcony accessed from both the living area and bedroom, enjoying elevated views across the surrounding area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Spacious one-bedroom apartment\r\n• Bright open-plan living accommodation\r\n• Generous double bedroom\r\n• Private balcony with access from the living room and bedroom\r\n• Designated car-parking space\r\n• Fully fitted kitchen\r\n• Timber flooring throughout the principal rooms\r\n• Electric heating\r\n• Well-maintained development\r\n• Excellent Dublin 8 location\r\n• Within walking distance of Dublin city centre\r\n• Convenient access to the LUAS and Dublin Bus services"
      },
